WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.328
A rover driven from Earth.

00:03.028 --> 00:04.759
Nobody rode it.

00:05.209 --> 00:12.517
A team of five controllers on Earth drove it by its television pictures, at one or two kilometres an hour.

00:12.967 --> 00:20.413
It was built to last three lunar days and kept going for eleven, 322 Earth days in all.
